layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Deslop — Live duplicate-code server for AI coding agents
description: A running LSP + MCP server that streams real-time duplicate-code signals to Claude, Cursor, Copilot, and your editor as code is written. Tree-sitter parsing, AST fingerprints, semantic fusion — worst offenders surface inline, not in a batch report after the copy-paste already landed.
---

<div class="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__left">
      <div class="eyebrow-chip"><span>v2.4.0-stable released</span></div>
      <h1>
        Your agent is about to copy-paste.
        <em>Deslop tells it not to.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        Deslop is a <strong>live analysis server</strong> — LSP + MCP, running in your workspace — that feeds real-time duplicate-code signals to Claude, Cursor, Copilot, and your editor <em>as code is written</em>. Tree-sitter parsing, AST fingerprints, semantic fusion, millisecond response. Batch CLI reports are one output; the live stream is the product.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a href="/docs/" class="btn-primary">Run Demo Scan</a>
        <div class="install-chip">
          <code>cargo install deslop</code>
          <button aria-label="Copy install command">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">content_copy</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

